  "content": {
    "title": "McDonald's KPop Demon Hunters meals are here! What time to get them",
    "text": "March 31, 2026Updated April 1, 2026, 10:30 a.m. ETThe McDonald's \"KPop Demon Hunters\" meal is here!The fast-food giant began offering a pair of meals inspired by the Netflix film on Tuesday, March 31.One meal honors the animated movie's female girl group, Huntr/X, who battle demons with music. The other meal celebrates the Saja Boys, a boy band made up of demons, who attempt to disrupt that mission.McDonald's also released a McFlurry inspired by the movie's adorable character, Derpy the Tiger.So, what exactly is in the meals? And when and where can you buy them? Here's what to know:Huntr/X Meal10-piece chicken McNuggetsMedium soft drinkRamyeon McShaker Fries: Fries with a soy, garlic, sesame and spice seasoning. The side is inspired by Rumi, Mira and Zoey's go-to noodle snack. You sprinkle the seasoning into the McShaker bag, add fries and shake to distribute the seasoning on the ries.Hunter Sauce: A sweet chili sauce with notes of chili, garlic and pepper. Inspired by HUNTR/X's \"fierce, yet fun-loving personalities,\" according to the McDonald's release.Demon Sauce: A mustard sauce with heat and tang. The sauce is made purple as a nod to the color of demon patterns.Saja Boys Breakfast MealSpicy Saja McMuffin: The Sausage McMuffin with Egg, topped with a peppery Spicy Saja Sauce. The sauce is \"inspired by the fire of Gwi-Ma.\"Hash browns: \"Crispy on the outside and soft on the inside − just like the Saja Boys' leader Jinu,\" the release reads.Small soft drink: \"Your choice of a little 'Soda Pop' to cool down from the heat,\" the release reads. \"Soda Pop\" is the name of one of the Saja Boys' songs.The Derpy McFlurryThe Derpy McFlurry blends vanilla soft serve with berry-popping pearls in a wild berry sauce.'KPop Demon Hunters' McDonald's cardsEach meal also comes with a collectible card pack. Each pack consists of a photocard for either Huntr/X or the Saja Boys and a Derpy access card with a QR code that unlocks exclusive content via the McDonald's app. That content is \"a special reveal of the group that wins the Battle for the Fans,\" according to a McDonald's news release.What time does McDonald's stop serving breakfast?Local breakfast menus and hours may vary by restaurant, which Co-Ops and franchisees decide at their discretion, according to the McDonald's website. However, most McDonald's locations serve breakfast items until 10:30 a.m. or 11 a.m. local time.When does McDonald's start serving lunch?Local lunch menus and hours also may vary by restaurant, which Co-Ops and franchisees decide at their discretion. However, the lunch menu generally becomes available when the breakfast menu changes over. So, most McDonald's start serving lunch around 10:30 a.m. or 11 a.m. local time.McDonald's locations around Greater Cincinnati302 Philadelphia St., Covington.15 Donnermeyer Drive, Bellevue.1126 E. McMillan St., Walnut Hills.1930 Monmouth St., Newport.413 Martin Luther King Drive, Avondale.3738 Warsaw Ave., East Price Hill.3903 Winston Ave., Covington.255 W. Mitchell Ave., Spring Grove Village.4594 Montgomery Road, Norwood.10573 Springfield Pike, Woodlawn.4025 Mt. Carmel Tobasco Road, Springfield Township.2513 Hazelwood Drive, Crescent Springs.8530 U.S. Highway 42, Union.8300 Arbor Square Drive, Mason.7679 Doc Drive, West Chester.2930 W. Montgomery Road, Maineville.7085 Liberty Centre Drive, West Chester.9142 Cincinnati Columbus Road, West Chester.8969 Fields Ertel Road, Symmes Township.738 Corwin Nixon Blvd., South Lebanon.3880 Paxton Ave., Oakley. 6726 Dixie Highway, Florence. 5427 Ridge Ave., Columbia Township.7337 Wooster Pike, Columbia Township.3050 Dixie Highway, Erlanger.7671 Beechmont Ave., Anderson Township.7916 Montgomery Road, Sycamore Township.4025 Mount Carmel Tobasco Road, Beechmont.5341 Glenway Ave., West Price Hill.7909 Dream St., Florence.6707 Alexandria Pike, Alexandria.6 Sperti Drive, Edgewood.5010 Delhi Road, Delhi Township.5055 Old Taylor Mill Road, Taylor Mill.3720 Alexandria Pike, Cold